<article id="post-9667" class="post-9667 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-cse-issuer-stories category-cse-magazine tag-caleb-stroup tag-cse-issuer-stories tag-cse-magazine tag-csehwg tag-headwater-gold tag-otcqbhwauf">
	
	<a class="post-thumbnail" href="https://blog.thecse.com/focused-portfolio-and-a-smart-business-model-give-this-explorer-every-chance-at-success/" aria-hidden="true">
	<img width="672" height="372" src="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Headwater-Gold-Blog-Header-672x372.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Focused Portfolio and a Smart Business Model Give This Explorer Every Chance at Success" decoding="async" srcset="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Headwater-Gold-Blog-Header-672x372.jpg 672w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Headwater-Gold-Blog-Header-300x166.jpg 300w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Headwater-Gold-Blog-Header-1024x568.jpg 1024w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Headwater-Gold-Blog-Header-768x426.jpg 768w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Headwater-Gold-Blog-Header.jpg 1038w" sizes="(max-width: 672px) 100vw, 672px" data-attachment-id="9669" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/focused-portfolio-and-a-smart-business-model-give-this-explorer-every-chance-at-success/headwater-gold-blog-header/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Headwater-Gold-Blog-Header.jpg" data-orig-size="1038,576" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="Headwater Gold- Blog Header" data-image-description="&lt;p&gt;Headwater Gold Blog Header Image&lt;/p&gt;
