	<img width="672" height="372" src="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Exploits-Discovery-Long-Blog-Header-672x372.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="High-Grade Gold Projects in Eastern Canada Form Basis for Resource Expansion Plan" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Exploits-Discovery-Long-Blog-Header-672x372.jpg 672w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Exploits-Discovery-Long-Blog-Header-300x166.jpg 300w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Exploits-Discovery-Long-Blog-Header-1024x568.jpg 1024w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Exploits-Discovery-Long-Blog-Header-768x426.jpg 768w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Exploits-Discovery-Long-Blog-Header.jpg 1038w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 672px) 100vw, 672px" data-attachment-id="9665" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/high-grade-gold-projects-in-eastern-canada-form-basis-for-resource-expansion-plan/exploits-discovery-long-blog-header/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Exploits-Discovery-Long-Blog-Header.jpg" data-orig-size="1038,576" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="Exploits Discovery- Long Blog Header" data-image-description="&lt;p&gt;Exploits Discovery Blog Header&lt;/p&gt;
