<article id="post-9634" class="post-9634 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-cse-issuer-stories category-cse-magazine tag-cse-issuer-stories tag-cse-magazine tag-csemetg tag-metaguest-ai tag-tony-comparelli">
	
	<a class="post-thumbnail" href="https://blog.thecse.com/leading-hotel-brands-look-to-canadian-ai-for-better-stays-operating-efficiency-and-incremental-revenue/" aria-hidden="true">
	<img width="672" height="372" src="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Metaguest.AI-Blog-Header-672x372.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Leading Hotel Brands Look to Canadian AI for Better Stays, Operating Efficiency, and Incremental Revenue" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Metaguest.AI-Blog-Header-672x372.jpg 672w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Metaguest.AI-Blog-Header-300x166.jpg 300w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Metaguest.AI-Blog-Header-1024x568.jpg 1024w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Metaguest.AI-Blog-Header-768x426.jpg 768w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Metaguest.AI-Blog-Header.jpg 1038w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 672px) 100vw, 672px" data-attachment-id="9635" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/leading-hotel-brands-look-to-canadian-ai-for-better-stays-operating-efficiency-and-incremental-revenue/metaguest-ai-blog-header/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Metaguest.AI-Blog-Header.jpg" data-orig-size="1038,576" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="Metaguest.AI- Blog Header" data-image-description="&lt;p&gt;Metaguest.AI Blog Header&lt;/p&gt;
